WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.800
… allowed to be strong in my softness.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.200
Our mind is everywhere, we get pulled in every direction …

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.900
At The Water Devotion, you get to arrive

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:18.000
and discover: what is my truth in this very moment?

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:23.800
It can be easy. I can feel. Everything is allowed to be here.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:31.100
Just as I am right now, just as I show up – I get to flow.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.400
We often don't even notice how much we hold our breath.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:40.400
I can breathe out. How far can I actually exhale? Is there a little more?

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:46.500
It's allowed to hurt, too. We step into a space where every emotion

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:55.900
isn't judged, but simply allowed to flow through us – and we get to dance with it.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:03.800
When you open yourself to working with me, with The Water Devotion,

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:11.000
you can expect to become strong in your softness –

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:23.400
and for movement and fluidity to become a natural devotion in your everyday life.

